{"spec_id":"2a173073-85c0-49f1-9be7-40c8d75f8547","name":"mokhalil","content":{"content":[{"id":"c0c875fd-c916-4310-bf7d-55519dc3e809","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[],"children":[]},{"id":"dec819b2","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":1,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Landing Page Specification","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"9d89febe","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The purpose of this document is to define the requirements for the main landing page of the application. The landing page serves as the primary entry point for users, designed to convert visitors into registered users by highlighting the value proposition and providing clear calls to action.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"bc22a806","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Requirements","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"85753a08","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The landing page must be responsive, performant, and aligned with the brand identity. ","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"c2ea0aa6","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":3,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Localization & Market","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"bd7906d6","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Target Market","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": The site must be optimized for the Middle Eastern market (specifically Egypt/GCC).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"9dde0cde","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Language Support","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": The layout must support Right-to-Left (RTL) for Arabic and Left-to-Right (LTR) for English.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"2f13b9bc","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"Bi-directional (BiDi) Text","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": The system must correctly handle mixed-language strings (e.g., English brand names within Arabic sentences) to prevent punctuation mirroring issues and incorrect character ordering.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"1f6ed307","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hosting/CDN","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": Content must be served via a regional CDN to ensure low latency for users in the MENA region.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"9cf97a8d","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":3,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Functional Requirements","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"0d9b69d6","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hero Section","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": Must include a compelling headline, a sub-headline, and a primary \"Get Started\" call-to-action (CTA) button. The hero image should be optimized for both desktop and mobile aspect ratios.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"d6d7bf37","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Features Overview","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": A section detailing at least three key benefits of the platform with icons and descriptions. Each feature card should be interactive (e.g., hover states).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"855768e6","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Testimonials","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": A section displaying social proof from existing users, including their name, role, and a profile picture.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"be4b64c5","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Navigation Bar","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":":","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"b2930582","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - Links to \"Features\", \"Pricing\", and a \"Login\" button.\n    - Must remain sticky at the top of the page during scroll.\n    - Mobile version must use a \"hamburger\" menu.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"52033009","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lead Capture","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": A newsletter signup form in the footer or a dedicated section with email validation.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"dfcbeb1b","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"Data Privacy","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": The form must explicitly comply with local privacy regulations (e.g., Saudi Arabia's PDPL and Egypt's Data Protection Law), including clear consent checkboxes and links to a localized Privacy Policy addressing data residency.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"94152613","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Footer","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":":","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"4e694720","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - \"About\" section containing company information.\n    - Legal links (Privacy Policy, Terms of Service), social media icons, and contact information.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"78da68ec","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":3,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Non-Functional Requirements","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"db043541","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Performance","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": The page should load in under 2 seconds on a standard 4G connection.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"9635e0b5","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"Asset Optimization","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": Total page weight must not exceed 1.5MB. The Hero image must be specifically optimized (WebP format, responsive sizes) to meet LCP goals.\n    - Core Web Vitals (LCP, FID, CLS) must meet \"Good\" thresholds.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"d104941f","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"blue","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"SEO","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":":","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"de4caafd","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - Must include meta tags (title, description), Open Graph tags for social sharing, and alt text for all images.\n    - Use semantic HTML5 tags (header, nav, main, section, footer) for search engine optimization.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"55af134a","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Accessibility","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": Must comply with WCAG 2.1 Level AA standards, including keyboard navigation support and screen reader compatibility.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"11ea0c6e","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Security","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": All forms must include CSRF protection and rate limiting to prevent spam submissions.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"ae4a28a6","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Scalability","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": The landing page should be able to handle a burst of 10,000 concurrent users during marketing campaigns.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"3f881d16","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"Caching","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": Implement edge caching for the static HTML to ensure origin server stability during high-traffic bursts.\n    - ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"Statelessness","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":": The frontend must remain stateless to facilitate horizontal scaling.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"16939348","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Open Questions","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"a6dbac73","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"What is the specific color palette and typography for the brand identity?","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"63a7de51","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Are there specific testimonials ready for use, or should placeholders be used?","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"5e8b1703","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Which social media platforms should be linked in the footer?","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"b1f9aa38-1870-4b9a-b1dc-907953ccf12f","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[],"children":[]}],"comments":[{"threadId":"01a4bf6d-cfd3-406d-ab19-74ce70a53eed","text":"The landing page should be able to handle a burst of 10,000 concurrent users during marketing campaigns.","occurrence":0,"resolved":true,"comments":[{"id":"80d47b7d-0855-42f8-a3a9-eefad5646fca","author":{"id":"ai-planner","username":"ai-planner"},"text":"Recommend adding a requirement for 'Statelessness' or 'Edge Caching' of the HTML itself to ensure the 10k concurrent user load doesn't overwhelm the origin server during peak marketing spend.","createdAt":"2026-07-31T11:28:43.455Z"}]}]}}